  "annotations": [
    { "id": "setup-notes", "page": "setup", "x": 0, "y": 1280, "w": 900, "text": "Setup flow. The TV only needs input to start the room; after that the VIP (first phone to join) runs everything from their phone, and the TV mirrors what they pick.\nAll names, the room code and the QR are sample content." },
    { "id": "imposter-notes", "page": "imposter", "x": 6120, "y": 1280, "w": 900, "text": "Imposter, one word shown end to end: Priya holds the decoy (ZEBRA), the crew has GIRAFFE.\n\nAssumptions to check:\n- The speaker taps \"I'm done\" to pass the turn, or the timer runs out.\n- You can vote for anyone but yourself.\n- The crew's word stays hidden on the TV until the imposter's last guess is in.\n- Point values are placeholders until the spec sets scoring.\n- Not drawn yet: the round where the imposter escapes the vote." },
    { "id": "real-or-nah-notes", "page": "real-or-nah", "x": 4080, "y": 1280, "w": 900, "text": "Real or Nah, one fact shown end to end.\n\nAssumptions to check:\n- The reveal puts everything on one screen here; the build can play it lie by lie.\n- Answers appear in the same shuffled order on the TV and every phone.\n- Point values are placeholders until the spec sets scoring." },
    { "id": "end-notes", "page": "end-system", "x": 1000, "y": 1280, "w": 900, "text": "End of a game and the system states. Bracketed items on the credits and full-tonight screens are real facts still to fill in (repo URL, music, sound effects)." },
    { "id": "style-intro", "page": "style-options", "x": 0, "y": -260, "w": 1100, "text": "The two style options that weren't picked, kept for reference. Doodle Notebook (option C) is now the main set on the other pages." },
    { "id": "direction-a", "page": "style-options", "x": 2530, "y": 0, "w": 460, "text": "A · Sticker Shop\nThick ink outlines, hard offset shadows, flat bold colors on warm cream. Lilita One + Nunito." },
    { "id": "direction-b", "page": "style-options", "x": 2530, "y": 1320, "w": 460, "text": "B · Saturday Morning\nDeep grape stage, candy-colored bubbles, no outlines. Titan One + Baloo 2." }
  ],
